WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.910
The ditch is around 800ft
long and 26ft wide, and

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:07.220
appears to form the
outline of the triangle

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.210
in the image.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:13.580
The entire length is
paralleled by the biggest

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.230
concrete wall I think
I've ever seen.

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:21.610
A section of the wall
draws Giannulli's eye.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:25.810
Holy cow! Look at this.

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:32.390
These look like pock
marks from some sort of

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:36.290
explosion. Some of these
are half a foot to almost

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:40.940
a foot deep. This has to
be the result of

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.680
artillery fragmentation.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.900
I can see what's going
on here.

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:46.370
This is definitely a
fort.

